    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">SingularUnit</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The purpose of the om:SingularUnit class is to describe a unit of measure that is not explicitly represented as a combination of multiple units, but could be equivalent to such a representation.</rdfs:comment>
