    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">This property can be used in a Measure, SingularUnit or PrefixedUnit. For Measure and PrefixedUnit, the om:hasUnit property is REQUIRED and MUST contain a IRI that refers to a om:Unit. For SingularUnit, the om:hasUnit is OPTIONAL and MAY contain a IRI.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
