    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A VariableFeature object can have zero or more variantMeasure properties, each of type IRI, specifying a om:Measure object. This property specifies numerical values that are options to be applied to the variable Feature from the template when deriving a new Component.</rdfs:comment>
