    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The hashAlgorithm property is OPTIONAL and MAY contain the name of the hash algorithm used to generate the value of the hash property. The value of this property SHOULD be a hash name string from the IANA Named Information Hash Algorithm Registry, of which sha3-256 is currently RECOMMENDED. If the hash property is set, then hashAlgorithm MUST be set as well.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
