    <rdfs:comment rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">TODO: Custom data in the form of independent objects can participate in the SBOL data model if they are assigned one of the SBOL types Identified or TopLevel. An example is an RDF object that is annotated such that it represents a data sheet that describes the performance of a Component in a particular context.</rdfs:comment>
